      "description": "First project-side materialization of the attacker-controlled lookup object on the crashing path. The contextual entry's `currentIndex` selects one slot from the font-backed `substitutionTables` list, and this line turns that slot into the `lookup` reference later used to obtain `replacement`."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "r_contextual_lookup_offset_nonzero",
