      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "REQ-contextual-lookup-offset-nonzero",
      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "Root cause. Contextual substitution-table entries are stored as null-enabled offsets, so dereferencing a zero `substitutionTables[currentIndex]` slot materializes `Null(Lookup<GlyphID>)` instead of rejecting the malformed font. Later code then treats that zero-filled null object as a real lookup."
    },
    {
