        "right": "NULL"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "OBS-current-replacement-pointer-nonnull",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "Final crashing read. Dereferencing the forged `GlyphID *replacement` invokes this big-endian 16-bit load, and ASan reports its first byte as a global-buffer-overflow."
    },
